WEBVTT

00:46:26.530 --> 00:46:31.656
what I realized was, work isn't
the most important thing for me.

00:46:31.680 --> 00:46:35.213
If I had a few hundred days
or 100 days of life left,

00:46:35.237 --> 00:46:38.033
I'd want to spend it
with the people I love.

00:46:38.057 --> 00:46:41.339
I want to give back
the love they've given me,

00:46:41.363 --> 00:46:44.609
and I've been too selfish to only do work.

00:46:44.633 --> 00:46:46.366
So that's what woke me up.

00:46:46.720 --> 00:46:49.299
And I think that revelation,

00:46:49.323 --> 00:46:53.768
translated to the AI-induced
job displacement,

00:46:53.792 --> 00:46:59.219
is that, have we, as humanity,
been brainwashed

00:46:59.243 --> 00:47:00.919
by the importance of work?